---
import { getMaxAudioBytes } from '../../lib/upload.js';
const maxMb = getMaxAudioBytes() / 1024 / 1024;
---
<div class="space-y-3" data-music>
  <div>
    <p class="text-sm font-medium">Lagu terpilih</p>
    <p data-music-none class="text-sm text-gray-500">Belum ada lagu dipilih.</p>
    <audio data-music-preview controls preload="none" class="mt-1 hidden w-full"></audio>
    <button type="button" data-music-clear
      class="mt-1 hidden rounded border px-3 py-1 text-xs text-red-600 hover:bg-red-50">Lepas lagu</button>
  </div>

  <div>
    <p class="text-sm font-medium">Pustaka lagu</p>
    <ul data-music-list class="mt-1 space-y-1"></ul>
    <label class="mt-2 inline-block cursor-pointer rounded border px-3 py-1.5 text-sm hover:bg-gray-50">
      Unggah lagu (MP3, M4A, OGG · maks {maxMb} MB)
      <input type="file" accept="audio/mpeg,audio/mp4,audio/ogg,.mp3,.m4a,.ogg" class="hidden" data-music-upload />
    </label>
    <p data-music-msg class="mt-1 text-xs text-red-600"></p>
  </div>

  <label class="flex items-center gap-2 text-sm">
    <input type="checkbox" data-bind="music.autoplay" /> Putar otomatis
  </label>
  <label class="flex items-center gap-2 text-sm">
    <input type="checkbox" data-bind="music.loop" /> Ulangi terus (loop)
  </label>
  <div>
    <label for="f-music-volume" class="block text-xs text-gray-600">Volume</label>
    <input id="f-music-volume" type="range" min="0" max="100" step="5"
      data-bind="music.volume" data-type="number" class="w-full" />
  </div>

  <p class="text-xs text-gray-500">
    Putar otomatis dimulai saat tamu menekan "Buka Undangan", karena browser melarang suara otomatis sebelum ada interaksi.
    Pastikan kamu berhak memakai lagu yang diunggah. Menghapus file lagu dilakukan di halaman Kelola.
  </p>
  <p class="text-sm text-red-600" data-error-for="music.assetId"></p>
</div>